    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/76da21c6a5628d562b80d7331c73ac38.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every summer, your sister's three daughters get to be a bit too much for her, so she sends them to your country home, where life is different from the big city. No one lives nearby, and there's nothing to do but relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/03f8e05b8aff3b2bfa84c4a13820979e.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day in this text-based adventure game, you'll be able to choose which niece to spend time with during the morning, afternoon, and evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the activities will be fun, like karaoke, while other tasks are tougher, like gardening or working together on creating manga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with all of the sisters to reach the finale, when the sisters go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/5da60534275cbb826546bd3417388f87.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/096b68c5130a066af53eca74fe97e834.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/ff3156d8aa3de6494bdc3ff101f9ef29.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/d64f0bc6c5f31cfb020d18a9c30d5df2.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/67be719e0f2c89faf6125e1fda01a1c6.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Spend Time with Every Sister</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either focus on your favorite sister, viewing their story to the end, or mix and match, enjoying joyful days with all three of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Have a Fulfilling Summer Vacation</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure all three of your nieces have a great time at your home while still managing to get all of your own work done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/76da21c6a5628d562b80d7331c73ac38.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every summer, your sister's three daughters get to be a bit too much for her, so she sends them to your country home, where life is different from the big city. No one lives nearby, and there's nothing to do but relax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/03f8e05b8aff3b2bfa84c4a13820979e.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day in this text-based adventure game, you'll be able to choose which niece to spend time with during the morning, afternoon, and evening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some of the activities will be fun, like karaoke, while other tasks are tougher, like gardening or working together on creating manga.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend time with all of the sisters to reach the finale, when the sisters go home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/5da60534275cbb826546bd3417388f87.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/096b68c5130a066af53eca74fe97e834.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/ff3156d8aa3de6494bdc3ff101f9ef29.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/d64f0bc6c5f31cfb020d18a9c30d5df2.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=275 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3606380/extras/67be719e0f2c89faf6125e1fda01a1c6.avif?t=1746594119\" width=616 height=73 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Spend Time with Every Sister</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Either focus on your favorite sister, viewing their story to the end, or mix and match, enjoying joyful days with all three of them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Have a Fulfilling Summer Vacation</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure all three of your nieces have a great time at your home while still managing to get all of your own work done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
